[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0129","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0129.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0047","title":"Olaf Titz CIPE 畸形数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CIPE VPN 软件包 1.3.0-3 之前版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形短数据包触发该漏洞，导致 CIPE VPN 服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 CIPE VPN 1.3.0-3 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，但仅影响系统可用性。Debian 已在安全公告 DSA-104 中发布修复补丁，建议用户升级至 1.3.0-3 及以上版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0047"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-01-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 CIPE VPN 至 1.3.0-3 或更高版本。Debian 用户可通过 `apt-get update && apt-get upgrade cipe` 命令更新。如无法升级，可在防火墙上配置规则过滤发往 CIPE 端口的畸形 UDP 短包，或限制可访问 CIPE 服务的源 IP 范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-104","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-007.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7883","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0047.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0047","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0047.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0047.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-104.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0047.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0047.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-104.data","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--706801f4-cc42-4c40-8ce0-6dfb3f9e9fc9.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0129.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0128","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0046","title":"Linux kernel ICMP分片包内存信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 内核及部分其他操作系统在处理分片 ICMP 数据包时存在内存信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的分片 ICMP 报文，当报文触发 TTL 超时后，系统生成的 ICMP TTL Exceeded 响应数据包中会包含内核内存中的部分数据，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，影响范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0046"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-01-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至厂商修复版本。Red Hat 已发布 RHSA-2002-007 安全公告，建议更新内核至包含 ICMP 分片包内存泄露修复的版本。如无法立即升级，可在边界防火墙上配置规则丢弃异常分片 ICMP 数据包，并启用内核 sysctl 参数 net.ipv4.icmp_ignore_bogus_error_responses=1 以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/5394","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-007.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/251418","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7998","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0046.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0046","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0046.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0046.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3578-p22m-362p/GHSA-3578-p22m-362p.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0046.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89649/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0046.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148200_148300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0128.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0127","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0127.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0045","title":"OpenLDAP slapd 访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"OpenLDAP 2.0 至 2.0.19 版本的 slapd 守护进程存在访问控制缺陷，本地用户及 2.0.8 之前的匿名用户可对访问控制列表执行不含任何值的 \"replace\" 操作，导致 OpenLDAP 删除本应受 ACL 保护的非强制属性。攻击者无需认证即可通过网络远程利用该漏洞，造成目标系统敏感属性被篡改或删除，影响数据的完整性和可用性。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0045"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-01-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenLDAP 至 2.0.20 或更高版本，可从 http://www.openldap.org/software/download/ 获取。如无法升级，可应用补丁 http://www.openldap.org/devel/cvsweb.cgi/servers/slapd/acl.c.diff?r1=1.27.2.18&r2=1.27.2.19 修复 slapd 的 ACL 检查逻辑。临时缓解措施：限制匿名用户绑定权限，在 slapd.conf 中将匿名用户访问控制设为 read 级别。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000459","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:013","http://www.openldap.org/lists/openldap-announce/200201/msg00002.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5395","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-014.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3945","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBTL0201-020","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7978","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0045.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0045","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0045.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0045.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-8pp4-vvw3-g4g7/GHSA-8pp4-vvw3-g4g7.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0045.md","https://github.com/EGI-Federation/bdii-inspec-profile/blob/eb41838642afe8cbf3b54654d3549f951446b292/controls/openldap-cve.rb","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8583a3b0-5a4d-479a-ae79-e43f5350a48f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0045.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0126","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0126.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0044","title":"GNU Enscript 符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"GNU Enscript 1.6.1 及之前版本在创建临时文件时未采取安全的文件命名机制，存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在目标系统上预创建指向任意文件的符号链接，诱使 Enscript 在处理文件时覆盖攻击者指定的任意文件，导致敏感数据破坏或权限提升。攻击条件为拥有本地用户权限，无需交互即可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0044"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-01-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:39Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Enscript 至 1.6.2 或更高版本。Debian 系统执行 apt-get install enscript 更新至修复版本（参考 DSA-105）；Red Hat 系统应用 RHSA-2002:012 更新；Mandrake 系统安装 MDKSA-2002:010 补丁。临时缓解措施：避免以特权用户身份运行 enscript，或设置更严格的 umask 限制临时文件权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-105","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-010.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-012.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3818","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3920","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7932","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0044.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0044","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0044.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0044.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-105.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rcv5-2pf2-pw75/GHSA-rcv5-2pf2-pw75.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0044.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148200_148300.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-010.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f1f6870b-2b03-46c2-80b3-8ebe03b6a8d7.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0126.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0125","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0043","title":"Sudo sudo 环境变量未清理导致本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Sudo 1.6.0 至 1.6.3p7 版本在调用邮件程序时未能正确清理环境变量，导致本地攻击者可通过修改特定环境变量（如 PATH、IFS 等）来改变邮件程序的调用方式，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。攻击者需要具有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞实现权限提升。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 sudo 的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0043"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-01-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:38Z","remediation":"升级 sudo 至 1.6.4 或更高版本，该版本在调用 mail 程序前会正确清理环境变量。如无法升级，可移除 sudo 的 mail 功能（在 sudoers 中设置 mailerpath 为空路径），或限制可执行 sudo 的用户范围以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000451","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:003","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101120193627756&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-101","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_002_sudo_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-011.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-013.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3800","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/250168","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3871","http://www.sudo.ws/sudo/alerts/postfix.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7891","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21227","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0043.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0043.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0043","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2