ost_bug.cgi 的 reporter 参数，可冒充其他用户提交漏洞报告。该漏洞影响所有 Bugzilla 2.14.1 之前版本，攻击复杂度低，无需任何权限，可导致用户身份伪造、数据完整性破坏，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0008"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-01-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:34Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Bugzilla 至 2.14.1 或更高版本（当前最新稳定版为 6.x 系列）。使用 tarball 安装的用户请下载 https://www.bugzilla.org/download/ 获取最新版；使用 CVS 的用户请执行 `cvs update` 同步至 2002-01-03 之后的代码。若暂时无法升级，可应用官方补丁 https://www.bugzilla.org/bugzilla2.14to2.14.1.patch 修补 2.14 版本。同时建议启用 HTTPS 强制加密 Cookie 传输，限制 Bugzilla 管理界面仅允许内网 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-01/0034.html","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=108385","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=108516","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-001.html","http://www.bugzilla.org/security2_14_1.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7804.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7805.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3793","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3794","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0008.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0008","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0008.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0008.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xg4h-4wcx-6x7v/GHSA-xg4h-4wcx-6x7v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0008.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt",