ccess 设为 off），或在 Bugzilla 配置中临时关闭 LDAP 认证方式，改用本地数据库认证作为替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0115.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0115.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0251","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0251.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0810","title":"Mozilla Bugzilla 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"CVE-2002-0810是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0810"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2002-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"请参考官方安全公告，及时安装安全更新或升级到最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T19:22:32Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0251.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0251.toml"}]